Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your PAN card can go dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and nobody will call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of us think PAN works
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.33,0:00:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But salary,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.97,0:00:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,FD interest and refunds run through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.77,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not linked to Aadhaar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your PAN becomes inoperative,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.27,0:00:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,switched off,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.89,0:00:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,not cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Many skipped the link.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The card is still in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,wallet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so why bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.25,0:00:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But here is the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,TDS,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,tax cut before money reaches you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,can jump to 20 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tax refund gets stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Switching PAN back on costs a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,1,000 rupee fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The twist:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,checking is quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the income tax e-filing portal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.06,0:00:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and see the link status.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not investment advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.39,0:00:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Send this to your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,whose FD interest runs on that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,old PAN.
